 "notes": [
  "MeSH terms and author keywords were re-fetched from PubMed for the retained records ({{N:note_mesh_keywords}}). (b) Lexicon: pre-specified term lists matched to MeSH, keywords, title and abstract (verbatim in {{N:note_mesh_keywords}}); LLM: concern-theme classifier. Both measured among critical records; trends are Spearman ρ (exact P) over 5 annual values and OR per year. (c-f) Weighted log-odds ratio with an informative Dirichlet prior (Monroe et al. 2008; prior from all retained records, α0=1000; terms in at least 20 records); z is the log-odds difference divided by its SE; records = documents containing the term in each group (2024-2025 vs 2021-2022 in (c) and (e); critical vs favourable in (d) and (f)); a negative z in (e) or (f) means the term was relatively more frequent in 2021-2022 or in favourable records. Plotted in {{F:lexicon_vs_llm_fig}} and {{F:terms_fig}}. Critical stance was Alarm or Caution.",
  "OR per year: record-level logistic regression on publication year with journal cluster-robust SEs."
 ],
